    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Turn-Based Card Strategy Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ultimate deck from over a thousand cards! Choose from seven races \u2014 Human, Elf, Undead, Demon, Orge, Halfblood, and Goblin \u2014 and four powerful classes: Mage, Priest, Ranger, and Warrior. Challenge players worldwide with your unique strategy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Master the Meta</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond collecting, dive into deep card development with mechanics like Extract, Evolution, Awakening, and Restoration. Strengthen your cards and outplay opponents with both strategy and tactics!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Diverse Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide range of content including World Exploration, Sky Tower, Arena, Dungeons, Trade Caravans. Team up with allies to conquer enemies and earn rich rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Class Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage: Specializes in area spell damage and debilitating curses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Priest: Excels at healing allies and providing defensive buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranger: Masters battlefield control and deadly ambushes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior: Delivers heavy physical damage and powerful attack buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Turn-Based Card Strategy Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ultimate deck from over a thousand cards! Choose from seven races \u2014 Human, Elf, Undead, Demon, Orge, Halfblood, and Goblin \u2014 and four powerful classes: Mage, Priest, Ranger, and Warrior. Challenge players worldwide with your unique strategy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Master the Meta</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond collecting, dive into deep card development with mechanics like Extract, Evolution, Awakening, and Restoration. Strengthen your cards and outplay opponents with both strategy and tactics!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Diverse Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide range of content including World Exploration, Sky Tower, Arena, Dungeons, Trade Caravans. Team up with allies to conquer enemies and earn rich rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Class Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage: Specializes in area spell damage and debilitating curses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Priest: Excels at healing allies and providing defensive buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranger: Masters battlefield control and deadly ambushes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior: Delivers heavy physical damage and powerful attack buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Expedition Call&quot; is a classic turn-based chess strategy competitive card game. Featuring seven distinct races and four core classes, the game offers a wide range of combinations. Players can build customized decks to suit different strategies and adapt to various challenges on the battlefield.",
